WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Reliable agents start with decisions that can be observed and explained.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Keep the useful data, measure failures, and improve the system deliberately.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The goal is not autonomous magic but a tool a team can safely operate.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Every step should be reviewable, testable, and clear to the people using it.
